---
import {nevadaComparison as edition,nevadaComparisonReview,nevadaComparisonSources} from '../../lib/nevada-project-comparison.mjs';
interface Props {record:(typeof edition.records)[number]}
const {record}=Astro.props;
const sources=nevadaComparisonSources(record),decision=nevadaComparisonReview.records[0];
---
<article class="page-section comparison-reading" data-nevada-project-comparison={record.record_id}>
 <div class="eyebrow">Excluded project comparison · {edition.review_date}</div>
 <h2>{record.title}</h2><p class="lede">{record.answer}</p>
 <p>Written and AI self-reviewed by Codex on {edition.review_date} under the <a href="/method/editorial-review/">owner-authorized review policy</a>. The sources below retain their {edition.source_inspection_date} inspection date; no fresh source check or independent review is claimed.</p>
 <section data-comparison-scope><h3>Two projects, not a third</h3><p>{record.scope}</p></section>
 <div class="comparison-table"><table data-nevada-project-matrix><caption>Separate project positions in the retained accounts</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Question</th><th scope="col">Thacker Pass</th><th scope="col">Rhyolite Ridge</th></tr></thead><tbody>{record.comparison_rows.map((row,index)=><tr data-comparison-row={index}><th scope="row">{row.dimension}</th>{[row.thacker,row.rhyolite].map(cell=><td><p>{cell.text}</p>{cell.source_ids.map(id=><p class="citations"><a href={`#comparison-source-${id}`}>{sources.find(s=>s.id===id)!.title}</a></p>)}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
 {record.sections.map((section,index)=><section data-comparison-section={index}><h3>{section.heading}</h3><p>{section.text}</p>{section.source_ids.length>0&&<p class="citations">Retained sources: {section.source_ids.map((id,i)=><>{i>0?' · ':''}<a href={`#comparison-source-${id}`}>{sources.find(s=>s.id===id)!.title}</a></>)}</p>}</section>)}
 <aside data-comparison-governance><h3>The existing conversion file remains separate</h3><p>This comparison does not revise the combined Phase 61 file or its source-triggered Phase 63 gate. It creates no additional Phase 61 file, Phase 60 decision, dated appointment or admitted operating series. The recorded conversion stage remains visible below.</p></aside>
 <section><h3>Next project-specific evidence</h3><ul>{record.next_artifacts.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul></section>
 <section><h3>Retained source records</h3><p>All eight records were inspected on {edition.source_inspection_date}. Publication, signature, effective, reporting and inspection dates have different meanings; the notes retain the original access limits.</p><ol>{sources.map(source=><li id={`comparison-source-${source.id}`} data-comparison-source={source.id}><p><a href={source.url}>{source.title}</a> — {source.publisher}; {source.role}.</p><p>{source.boundary}</p><details><summary>Dates, location and inspection limits</summary><ul>{Object.entries(source).filter(([key,value])=>value&&(key.endsWith('_date')||key==='period_end')).map(([key,value])=><li>{key.replaceAll('_',' ')}: {value}</li>)}</ul><p>{source.locator}</p><p>{source.inspection}</p></details></li>)}</ol></section>
 <details data-comparison-assessment><summary>Exact-version AI assessment</summary><p>{decision.decision}</p><ul>{decision.findings.map(f=><li>{f}</li>)}</ul><p>Assessed comparison SHA-256: <code>{decision.sha256}</code></p><a href="/data/build-decisions.json">Download the comparison, retained inputs and assessment</a></details>
 <nav aria-label="Separate Nevada project and place accounts" data-nevada-current-links><h3>Separate project and receiving-system accounts</h3><ul>{record.related.map(link=><li><a href={link.route}>{link.title}</a></li>)}<li><a href={record.prior_route}>Earlier governed Nevada comparison</a></li></ul><p>The child dossiers keep their own review dates and identity decisions. The comparison itself adds zero eligible projects.</p></nav>
</article>
<style>.comparison-reading{max-width:76ch;margin-inline:auto;line-height:1.75;overflow-wrap:anywhere}section,aside,nav,.comparison-table{margin-block:1.75rem}.comparison-table{overflow-x:auto}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}th,td{padding:.65rem;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid currentColor}caption{font-weight:600;text-align:left;margin-bottom:.5rem}.citations{font-size:.9rem}li{margin-block:.6rem}summary{cursor:pointer}summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid currentColor;outline-offset:4px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style>
